  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Acumen - Support for Hardest to Reach market support mechanism</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norad supports the Market Support Facility (MSF) of Acumen&apos;s Hardest-to-Reach fund, which aims to establish and support private providers of off-grid solar solutions to the hardest to reach populations in Sub-Saharan Africa. The MSF provides potential investees of the main fund with project development and TA, as well as grants, loans and equity investment. Norad&apos;s funds will contribute to the TA and grants, but not the loans or investment.The fund&#x2019;s investment plans are closely aligned with the energy transition plans in the target countries, as well as the national adaptation plans of many of them, where access to energy is highlighted as a key enabler of climate adaptation in rural communities. The investment plans also specifically target projects and companies where women, especially in rural areas, are the primary beneficiaries or prospective employees.</narrative>
  </description>
